{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/e7f8bf91fd21afa99a3b5926bf1a1991.avif?t=1773509472\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.poster.avif?t=1773509472\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.webm?t=1773509472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/bff550b288e78b977133a83263e9f5b0.mp4?t=1773509472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Dominion</strong> is a grim and harrowing tale of a World War I soldier trapped between life and death. After losing his family on the battlefield, he dies\u2014yet does not realize it. His soul now roams a distorted realm, searching for his daughter in the bleak night of the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the classics of the genre, the game is crafted with a deep love for gothic aesthetics by a small team of five developers. Their vision draws from legendary titles such as <i>Dark Souls</i>, <i>Diablo II</i>, and <i>Demon\u2019s Souls</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.poster.avif?t=1773509472\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.webm?t=1773509472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/506f3ce1642f84d8f5ff950ccde1ffb3.mp4?t=1773509472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Unique Storyline:</strong> The game combines a dark gothic atmosphere with elements of psychological horror, gradually revealing the bitter truth about the player\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Descent into Madness:</strong> You will be haunted by nightmarish visions and the ghost of the one you lost. She leads you through the darkness \u2014 but can you trust her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Hardcore Combat:</strong> Brutal battles in the spirit of <i>Dark Souls</i> and <i>Demon\u2019s Souls</i>, featuring bosses that embody the fears and guilt of the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Exploration of a Mysterious World:</strong> Discover four vast locations filled with secrets, lore, and terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa <strong>Next-Gen Graphics:</strong> A gothic world crafted with an astonishing level of detail and photorealism, immersing the player in an atmosphere of despair and melancholy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/3a2c107ae07414281bddbbb944fe2fb6.avif?t=1773509472\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/8b7aff305ba51d58884dc314a8d0e1e0.poster.avif?t=1773509472\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/8b7aff305ba51d588